; Linux kernel module host (LinuxKPI) - started by the boot loader (boot-start; used when Linux modules are on the CD; boot option /NOLINUXKPI skips it)
[AddReg]
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\linuxkpi","ErrorControl",0x00010001,0x00000001
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\linuxkpi","Group",0x00000000,"SCSI miniport"
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\linuxkpi","ImagePath",0x00020000,"system32\drivers\linuxkpi.sys"
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\linuxkpi","Start",0x00010001,0x00000000
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\linuxkpi","Type",0x00010001,0x00000001
